      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Increasing sensitivity to drugs, elimination of endotoxicosis, recovery of normal homeostatic control after hemocarboperfusion help to break off the vicious circles associated with severe cardiovascular disorders, and improve the effect of subsequent medication. Hemocarboperfusion added to combined intensive care and resuscitation procedures was associated with a 82.9% success rate."},
